{"title":"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The degree of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/f/a8fee164067d9a56fda622932c508aaf289beb49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x^2+1)^4 (x^3+1)^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"143\" height=\"21\" /> as a polynomial in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/9/e49ba9a989785d2ca8907d5dd9550cf083316dad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)} \\ 5 \\qquad \\text{(B)} \\ 7 \\qquad \\text{(C)} \\ 12 \\qquad \\text{(D)} \\ 17 \\qquad \\text{(E)} \\ 72$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"357\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Expanding each factor yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/d/7edc092e8f9ded84b467a37405d864b7f4413c3d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x^{8}+...)(x^{9}+...)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"137\" height=\"19\" />. The degree of the first factor is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, while the degree of the second factor is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Therefore, the degree of the polynomial is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/0/3208b9adced5f61c843b9a899f0efa0baad24e62.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8 + 9 = \\boxed{(\\textbf{D})\\ 17}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"130\" height=\"32\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/4/6b455b472c329154dcceee37befef02974967ebc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\deg{P(x)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"71\" height=\"20\" /> be the degree of a polynomial in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />.  Recall that for any polynomials <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/f/6efaaf74e576202fad965134bc49c6a34aac4c30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/d/d9dfe7c7a0b887097fa2227a230fc915ba2e5477.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" />, and nonnegative integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/6/866ad53ced979a01066343d029733d7d780da39e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\deg{(P(x)^n)} = n \\deg{P(x)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"202\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/5/a45bb10e1ae07540b43e95e2b50cf19f216306da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\deg{(P(x)Q(x))} = \\deg {P(x)} + \\deg {Q(x)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"309\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/c/69cebc11cb7c25e36060f87942e0feedaf936af6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\deg{((x^2+1)^4(x^3+1)^3)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"188\" height=\"21\" />  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/5/0254f07063e7946cebf2c72fcac73b7d80c3512f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$= \\deg{((x^2+1)^4)} + \\deg{((x^3+1)^3)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"274\" height=\"21\" />  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/3/833b7f148fa4f173b4cdfbde40d68c17f269df70.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$= 4 \\deg{(x^2+1)} + 3 \\deg{(x^3+1)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"255\" height=\"21\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/4/4a446a6da54d5faff2202eb2f7cd1e149bf99776.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$= 4 \\cdot 2 + 3 \\cdot 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"106\" height=\"15\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/d/73d6c652072fe4855a74ce101ceb166330027a27.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$= \\boxed{(\\textbf{D})\\ 17}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"85\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p><p>-mihirb, edited by j314andrews\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME\" title=\"1980 AHSME\">1980 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1980 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1980\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=198